  "polarization_consequence": "Finite pullback preserves the original and tautological relative ample bundles. Quasi-compact composition with large integer powers yields a vertical relatively ample twist and B|D*=L prime to the ak0 power. Final reduced model is unchanged; root FS curvature plus base form gives total Kahler positivity.",
